The `save` mode builds an air-gap bundle that redistributes the Technitium DNS
Server binary (`DnsServerPortable.tar.gz`), which is **GPL-3.0**. When you
distribute that bundle you must retain Technitium's license text and provide the
corresponding source or a written offer per the GPL; the upstream source is at
https://github.com/TechnitiumSoftware/DnsServer . (GPL-3.0 has no AGPL-style
network clause, so running the server as a service does not by itself trigger a
source-disclosure obligation.) The bundled .NET runtime is MIT — retain its
LICENSE.txt and ThirdPartyNotices.txt.

This installer is an independent work that orchestrates Technitium DNS Server; it
